   418→    title: Retrospective Verification
   419→    type: trait
   420→    tags: []
   421→    description: "Applied to specs describing already-implemented functionality where implementation
   422→      predates formal task tracking. Common scenarios: bootstrap specs, legacy adoption,
   423→      reverse-engineered specs from existing code. Specs with this trait: do not require linked
   424→      implementation tasks, must have verified_at and verified_by fields, status is manually set
   425→      rather than derived from task completion."
