   455→      - platform-renderer-trait
   456→    title: Platform Renderer Contract
   457→    type: trait
   458→    tags: []
   459→    description: Defines the contract all platform-specific skill renderers must implement. Each
   460→      renderer writes platform-specific output (SKILL.md with frontmatter, sidecar config files,
   461→      supporting directories) to a configurable output directory. Renderers support dry-run mode,
   462→      drift detection via per-platform hashes, and idempotent output (no file modification when
   463→      content unchanged).
   464→    depends_on: []
   465→    implements: []
   466→    relates_to: []
   467→    tests: []
   468→    traits: []
   469→    notes: []
   470→    created: 2026-02-15T22:40:41.969Z
   471→    acceptance_criteria:
   472→      - id: ac-1
   473→        given: a renderer implementation for platform X
   474→        when: render is called with a skill and project context
   475→        then: platform-specific output files are written to the configured output directory
   476→      - id: ac-2
   477→        given: a renderer
   478→        when: render completes
   479→        then: a PlatformRenderResult is returned with id, platform, action
   480→          (created/updated/unchanged/skipped), and output paths
   481→      - id: ac-3
   482→        given: a skill with supporting directories (references/, scripts/, assets/)
   483→        when: rendered for any platform
   484→        then: supporting directories are copied to the platform output directory
   485→      - id: ac-4
   486→        given: dryRun option is true
   487→        when: render is called
   488→        then: no files are written to disk and result action reflects what would happen
   489→      - id: ac-5
   490→        given: a custom outputDir is provided
   491→        when: render is called
   492→        then: output goes to the custom path instead of the platform default
   493→      - id: ac-6
   494→        given: a render completes successfully
   495→        when: the hash is stored
   496→        then: a per-platform render hash is written to .kspec/skills/<id>/.render-hash-<platform>
   497→    status:
   498→      maturity: draft
